cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SETU-X or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "SETU-X: a local-first experimental platform for microservices across heterogeneous (simulated) cloud environments"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Agarwal
    given-names: Parv
version: 0.6.0
abstract: >-
  A Docker-first microservices testbed with a gateway, replicated services, simulated
  AWS/Azure/GCP environment labels, bounded fault injection, retries, timeouts, circuit
  breakers, cross-environment fallback, an open-loop experiment harness with run-level
  statistics, and a dashboard. Results describe one machine; real cloud providers were not used.
keywords:
  - microservices
  - multi-cloud
  - resilience
  - circuit breaker
  - fault injection
  - experiment methodology
